WEBVTT

00:04:28.579 --> 00:04:30.538
out there, you just can't be brave.

00:04:30.538 --> 00:04:34.621
And so I think the job is dispelling

00:04:35.246 --> 00:04:39.538
the mythology about vulnerability
is weakness at work.

00:04:39.871 --> 00:04:44.871
I think we armourer more because there's
less trust, there's less confidence.

00:04:45.121 --> 00:04:49.329
And I think we slip into kind of who we
think we're supposed to be at work.

00:04:50.079 --> 00:04:54.996
And we armer up using things like cynicism
, perfectionism,

00:04:55.413 --> 00:04:59.079
needing to be the knower and be right
versus the learner and get it right.

00:04:59.913 --> 00:05:06.454
There are a lot of forms of armor that
can sometimes be rewarded at work.